      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I got this effect now.\nThe point is to separate the audio listener component.\nIt means:\n- Remove the audio listener component on the Camera.\n- Create GameObject and attach the audio listener (This GameObuject must don't have a parent)\nThen we can use audio filters to the audio listener.\nHowever, it is a very counterintuitive method. I want to edit audio filters on the Main Camera.",
