  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-03-18T11:22:03.267Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Unity documents say that \"You can modify the output of Audio Source and Audio Listener components by applying Audio Effects.\" However audio filters don't work for an audio listener on VRC.\nI want to make Yamabiko(echo) mountain world or cave with the reverb world. They need an audio filter that applies to an audio listener, right?\nSummary, I need audio filters that affect any player listens. Could you enable audio filters for an audio listener?",
